

========== 0. 版 ==========

$ cat /etc/almalinux-release
AlmaLinux release 9.7 (Moss Jungle Cat)

$ rpm -q openssh-server openssh-clients util-linux
openssh-server-8.7p1-49.el9_7.alma.1.x86_64
openssh-clients-8.7p1-49.el9_7.alma.1.x86_64
util-linux-2.37.4-21.el9_7.x86_64


========== 第2章 authorized_keys が group に書けるとき（本家に近い OpenSSH） ==========

$ useradd -m alice

$ su - alice -c 'ssh-keygen -q -t ed25519 -N "" -f ~/.ssh/id_ed25519 && cp ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub ~/.ssh/authorized_keys'

$ chmod 664 /home/alice/.ssh/authorized_keys; ls -l /home/alice/.ssh/authorized_keys; getent group alice
-rw-rw-r-- 1 alice alice 100 Oct 13 11:33 /home/alice/.ssh/authorized_keys
alice:x:1000:

$ su - alice -c 'ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new -o BatchMode=yes localhost true'; echo "終了コード $?"
Warning: Permanently added 'localhost' (ED25519) to the list of known hosts.
alice@localhost: Permission denied (publickey,gssapi-keyex,gssapi-with-mic,password).
終了コード 255

$ grep 'Authentication refused' /tmp/sshd.log
Authentication refused: bad ownership or modes for file /home/alice/.ssh/authorized_keys

$ chmod 600 /home/alice/.ssh/authorized_keys

$ su - alice -c 'ssh -o BatchMode=yes localhost echo 鍵で入れた'
鍵で入れた


========== 第6章 root がロックされているときの sulogin（本家の util-linux） ==========

$ grep '^root:' /etc/shadow | cut -d: -f1,2
root:*

$ script -qec sulogin /dev/null < /dev/null

Cannot open access to console, the root account is locked.
See sulogin(8) man page for more details.

Press Enter to continue.

